 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nWinged Wonders: 7 Days Tanzanian Birdwatching\nENQUIRE NOW\n\nfrom $2800pp\n\n*price based on 6 people sharing\n\nBEST TIME TO TRAVEL\n\nNov- Apr\n\nDURATION\n\n7 Days\n\nLOCATIONS\n\nArusha, Serengeti,\nNgorongoro Crater, Zanzibar\n\nSTARTING POINT\n\nFlight into Kilimanjaro\n\nWelcome to an extraordinary seven-day birdwatching safari through the heart of Tanzania, a journey that promises to captivate the senses and enrich your soul. From the lush, verdant landscapes of Arusha National Park to the shimmering waters of Lake Manyara and the surreal salt flats of Lake Natron, each destination offers a unique tapestry of vibrant avian life. Marvel at the boundless beauty of the Serengeti, where vast plains teem with wildlife, and descend into the Ngorongoro Crater, a breathtaking amphitheater that cradles one of the world's richest ecosystems. This trip is a haven for birdwatchers and wildlife enthusiasts alike, promising unrivaled encounters with Tanzania's diverse and magnificent fauna amidst its most iconic landscapes. So, grab your binoculars, ready your camera, and embark on this unforgettable adventure into the wild.\n\nITINERARY\n\nDay 1\nDay 2\nDay 3\nDay 4\nDay 5\nDay 6\nDay 7\n​\n\nDay 1: Arrival in ArushaYour adventure begins the moment you land at the airport, where you'll be greeted with a warm smile by your Mazingira Safari private guide, a seasoned expert in all things Tanzania—from the breathtaking national parks to its rich cultural tapestry. You'll then be whisked away to your charming Arusha accommodation. If you arrive early, you'll have the opportunity to explore the lodge's surroundings, immersing yourself in the tranquility of a nature walk or embarking on your first birdwatching excursion. Let the diverse melodies of local birdlife welcome you as you savor the anticipation of the days to come.\n\nMeal Plan\n\nBed & Breakfast, Dinner\n\nAccomodation\n\nNgaresero Mountain Lodge\n\nDestination\n\nArusha is known as the safari capital of Tanzania's Northern Safari Circuit.\n\nPackage Price includes:\n\n• English speaking professional guide;\n\n• Meals and accommodation as specified in the itinerary \n\n• Private transportation by FWD vehicle equipped with open roof \n\n• Airport Transfers \n\n• Park Entry Fees, VAT inclusive\n\n• Unlimited (pure) drinking water throughout the safari;\n\n• Game drives\n\n• Flying doctor \n\nPrices can vary between seasons\n\n$2800pp  6+ people\n\n$3099pp  4 people\n\n$3699pp  2 people \n\nPackage Price Does not include:\n\n• Airfares and related costs such as personal travel insurance, visas, and vaccinations;\n\n• Cost of any client-requested itinerary modifications while the safari is in progress;\n\n• Any expenses of a personal nature such as extra beverages, laundry, etc.;\n\n• Gratuity for your safari guides\n\n​\n\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
